{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We define the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Operation\" title=\"Operation\">operation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/b/15b50ddc4a2c97c3e32fd8f7131fdc16591f1c4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a*b = \\frac{1+a}{1+b^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/589930edf24fa232afa4ec08d7c73d1070fa6eb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall a,b \\in \\real$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dde46bec4f443fb4fa5ab3a5dfeb36484e5d2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2*0)*1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3355eeb0e8d1051e6acf259e53b486741ee31a00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 0\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"349\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86b2885c1843323636b4719c05f514c2daa5a03a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\frac{1+2}{1+0^2}}{1+1^2}=\\frac{1+3}{2}=2\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"224\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wik